### Subscribe to Email Updates
# Public endpoint for subscribing to email communications
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com"
}

### Confirm Subscription
# User clicks this link from their email to confirm subscription
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/confirm/abcdef123456789abcdef123456789abcdef123456789abcdef123456789

### Unsubscribe
# User clicks this link from their email to unsubscribe
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/unsubscribe/abcdef123456789abcdef123456789abcdef123456789abcdef123456789

# Preferences endpoint removed as we no longer store preferences

### Get All Subscriptions (Admin)
# Admin endpoint to get all subscriptions with optional filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions?page=1&limit=10&status=confirmed&source=website
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}

### Get Subscription by Email (Admin)
# Admin endpoint to get a specific subscription by email
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/customer@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}

### Delete Subscription (Admin)
# Admin endpoint to delete a subscription
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/customer@example.com
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}
